  <item>
    <title>EP.03 | 在北大读书，在冬奥志愿。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e83eed5ca6d0ace3579be4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e83eed5ca6d0ace3579be4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 14:21:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，你……还在嘛！我托力又回来了哟！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【这是一篇拖延稿……】怪我怪我，拖更太久，总是觉得不满意就一直压着一期又一期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间要拨回到2022年，一些陈旧但有趣的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【彩色的隔壁】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltc8NzQ-vwyto17amKfMm1kf3leQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【闭幕式现场布灵布灵】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtscQAvRgg352wUP2gQ-8TKsMCUY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【冬奥的唯一一场大雪】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgWGHIRiciZgNJdi2azCu3n6UUdL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【早上五点就起来的托力】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft0W-IZaklZ-eqPvZei7T9LzG-dw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期主播 | 托力</span></p><span></span><p><span>深入程度 | ★（故事分享，内容轻松）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【比赛还没开始】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 以志愿者身份，参与冬奥会。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> “闭环”——冬奥会的特有管理，就是我们被封闭了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 赛事志愿者的工作与排班——凌晨五点vs.夜里十一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 不开火的伙食。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【比赛现在开始】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 现实遇上学术研究的问题——数字鸿沟，我得给它填上。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">39:04</a> 墩墩热，志愿者也抢不到。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 颁奖广场的志愿者，比我们更辛苦，但她们放声高歌。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">53:57</a> 冬奥会哎，怎么可以没有雪。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3344">55:44</a> 别的班有的，B班小朋友也得有！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">63:02</a> 和米国的朋友，只能隔楼梯相望了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3992">66:32</a> 现场的闭幕式，真的很亮眼！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4373">72:53</a> 墩墩下班换成了容融，我们的心情也变了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4751">79:11</a> 场馆的女王节，每位女生都有花！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4802">80:02</a> 场馆里，认识的几位特别的朋友——花椒和巧克力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5452">90:52</a> 涨知识——冰壶为什么要搓搓搓。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5669">94:29</a> 妈妈！我蹦迪上报纸了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5861">97:41</a> 冰立方玄学：你永远可以相信B班……</span></p><span></span><p><span>要常来哟！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luA8250q002xX9Wxcou2Qgcw11t1.m4a" length="98511200" type="audio/mp4"/>
